  "prefLabel": "Lot 7002.33 Winner-take-all game",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Lot 7002.33 “Winner-take-all game” means a game, pursuant to RSA 287-E:7, XIII, in which all money received for the game is awarded, less the 7 percent (%) tax and 7% game reimbursement fee specified in RSA 287-E:7, XIII, to the winner of the game.\n\nSource. #13067, eff 6-26-20; ss by #14138, eff 11-27-24, EXPIRES: 11-27-34 (formerly Lot 7002.30)",
